## Architecture Impact

### **Before (Broken):**
```
VinylPlayer (local state) ←→ Store
VinylPlaylists (local state) ←→ Store

// Each component has its own copy of channelList, channelMetaMap
// Changes in one don't propagate to the other
```

### **After (Fixed):**
```
         ┌─────────────────────────────┐
         │  useVinylStore (Zustand)    │
         │  - channelList              │
         │  - channelMetaMap           │
         │  - customPlaylists          │
         └──────────────┬──────────────┘
                        │
         ┌──────────────┴──────────────┐
         │                              │
    VinylPlayer              VinylPlaylists
    (subscribes)             (subscribes)
    - reads channelList      - reads channelList
    - reads channelMetaMap   - reads channelMetaMap
    - updates filtered view  - updates status cycle
    - triggers re-render     - triggers re-render
```

**All tabs reactively subscribe to the same source of truth.**

